WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:08.610
can you be weak but strong at the same
time can you be weak but strong at the

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:14.190
same time yes you can you can't because
you can be for instance you can be

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:20.430
physically strong but at the same time
you could be mentally weak or you could

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:26.490
be the opposite you could be mentally
weak but at the same time physically

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:33.420
strong and I would love to be able to
put a priority on one of those and I

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:41.280
know I've said before that knowledge is
the most important thing but the reality

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:50.039
is if you don't have the strength or
actually the health to back that up or

00:00:50.039 --> 00:00:55.170
even to function as a human being
physically then your knowledge and your

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:58.940
