matter

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:07.890
so that comes into play and being big
and strong is also totally useless if

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:16.979
you're mentally weak and you quit now
being mentally strong should actually

00:01:16.979 --> 00:01:22.170
