because if you are mentally strong then

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:32.759
you can work and train to become
physically strong but if you're mentally

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:39.689
weak then you will not hold the line on
the good food and the good workouts and

00:01:39.689 --> 00:01:52.829
you won't get physically strong or
healthy so can you be weak and strong at

00:01:52.829 --> 00:02:01.799
the same time yes but I say be strong
train your physical strength and

00:02:01.799 --> 00:02:09.989
exercise your mental strength by doing
the right things the hard things the

00:02:09.989 --> 00:02:20.019
things you know you're supposed to do
do them and be as strong as you can

00:02:20.019 --> 00:02:30.690
mentally physically and emotionally for
yourself for your team for your family

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:37.470
hold the line and be strong

